  "body": "### Summary\n\nProposed by Bybifok (GitHub moust4ki, 2026-10-26): Emoji refusal with smiley suggestion\n\n### Scope\n\n**Emoji refusal with smiley suggestion**\n\n- Phase: 3–4 · Priority: medium · Status: proposed · Owner: —\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-012 (#45), LOT-048 (#74)\n\nNew engine work needed (no lot yet): emoji→smiley table\n\nEngine dependencies as written: 012, 048, **new** emoji→smiley table\n\n### Open questions\n\nHFR truncates at the first non-BMP character, BMP emoji untested\n\n### Spec\n\n`docs/features/FEAT-012.md` does not exist yet; create it when moving idea → spec (ADR 0011 §2).\n\n### Source\n\n[docs/FEATURES.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/FEATURES.md), [research/bybifok-proposals.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/research/bybifok-proposals.md); proposal credit stays with Bybifok (CREDITS.md).\n",
